$7600 b TitleActors 7 ; The title's attract scene: 26 actor records of 7 bytes (X, Y, kind, three bytes to +$3F, one to +$0A)
> $A73E reads 15 records from $7600 and later 11 from $7669 ($A7D3) through $A7DD: C, B and A ($65ED) for $A65D, then 3 bytes to the actor's +$3F-+$41 and one to +$0A. Witness: $7600-$76D1 read by $A73E (c48, gameover, menu).
$7669 ; the second group of 11 records ($A7D3)
