$76B6 b TitleActorOrder 13 ; 26 actor pages ($5D-$6B): the order the title scene steps its actors in
> $A775: H = (TitleSceneIndex), the page of the next actor. Witness: read by $A73E.
@res tables/title-order.bin
$76D0 b TitleSceneIndex 1 ; The title scene's index into TitleActorOrder ($B6 at the start) and its step count
> $A73E sets $B6, 0; $A788 increments both when an actor's counter ends (effect 11). $A7C3: step $1A, $1B and $0F end or switch the scene.
$76D1 TitleSceneStep ; steps done
$76D2 b GateRooms 6 ; Six rooms that hold a gate (the room numbers searched with CPIR by $8F28)
> FindGate $8F28: CPIR over these six for the room $6BDD, HL = the match + 6 (GateClosed). $8F01 then compares Hiro's X $5D01 with GateX and the side bit with $5D1B: D = 0 (no move) at the gate. $8F22 clears GateClosed: called at $97E5 when the guardian (an actor of kind $2A) is killed, effect 3.
