> Sub-opcode 0 of opcode 11 (table `$75EF` entry 0). ReadRunLen16 `$A3D1`: E cells from cell L; each cell of `$6B00` gets `$77`, or `$76` where it holds `$75`. Unmarked. Then RoomOpNext `$A1EE`.
