$A7B6 ; D = $A0, E = 1: the active bit, for $8A79 (not an address)
$A7BF ; the stage: $1A colour pass, $1B the high scores, $0F the second wave
$A7D1 ; stage $0F: the second wave, 11 pieces from $7669
$A7D7 LoadTitlePieces ; A pieces of 7 bytes at HL into the pages from $5D00
$A7DD LoadTitlePiecesLoop ; Y, X, frame (the template's last byte $65ED), InitActor with $65DC
